Description: Wayland virtual keyboard for GNU/Linux with modifier key support
 Vboard+ is an enhanced fork of vboard, a lightweight, customizable on-screen keyboard designed for Linux systems with Wayland support.
 It includes modifier keys such as Ctrl, Alt, Tab, Super (Meta/Win), a toggleable top Function Row, Arabic layout, and automatic system layout sync.
